# Battery profiles: special-case the profile selector item in module
# 32's settings apply dispatch, increment path. Companion to
# 0051-profile-selector-dispatch-a. NOT in the manifest: unstacked,
# same conditions as 0051.
name: profile-selector-dispatch-b
kind: module
module: 32
region: code
address: 0x0307dfe8
gate: build refuses unless the 6 stock bytes at the target equal
  `expect`; the finished image must also pass
  firmware_patch.validate(). Do NOT stack without the module 32
  segment extension carrying the battery-profile blob
  (work/power_build, linked at 0x030804ac); the cave target
  0x0308067a is inside that blob. If the blob's link base or layout
  changes, regenerate the branch bytes from src/sites.S.
rationale: Module 32 runs a second copy of its apply dispatch after
  the value editor's increment path, at exec 0x0307dfe0: 173 takes
  the EQ path at 0x0307dff8, 196 the brightness path at 0x0307e010,
  everything else exits at the function epilogue 0x0307e198. The 6
  bytes at this site are the second compare (cmp r0, #0xc4), its
  branch to 0x0307e010, and the exit branch. The replacement
  branches to the cave stub hook_dispatch_b at 0x0308067a, which
  re-executes the displaced compare and branch, tests the profile
  item id (0xc5), and on a match calls profile_select with the
  record's value byte, then exits through 0x0307e198, the same exit
  this copy's own special cases take. Non-profile items are
  behaviour-identical to stock.
expect: c42811d0d4e0
replace: 02f047bb00bf
